<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Humateck 판 플랜</title>
<script defer src="/_vercel/insights/script.js"></script>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#050b14;color:#f4f1e8;font-family:Arial,"Noto Sans KR",sans-serif}
.wrap{width:1120px;max-width:calc(100vw - 36px);margin:0 auto;padding:28px 0 70px}
.top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:30px}
.logo{width:190px;height:auto}
.nav{color:#f7d46a;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid rgba(214,176,78,.55);border-radius:999px;padding:10px 16px}
.hero,.notice,.planCard{border:1px solid rgba(214,176,78,.55);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(20,28,37,.96),rgba(10,16,23,.98));box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.32)}
.hero{border-radius:28px;padding:34px;margin-bottom:22px}
.kicker{color:#f7d46a;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:12px}
h1{font-size:42px;line-height:1.18;margin:0 0 16px;color:#4b97ff}
.hero p,.planCard p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#e8dfcf}
.notice{border-radius:20px;padding:18px;margin-bottom:22px;color:#f0dfb4;line-height:1.7}
.plans{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.planCard{border-radius:24px;padding:24px;min-height:250px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.planCard h2{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 12px;color:#fff}
.price{font-size:26px;font-weight:900;color:#ffd95a;margin-bottom:12px}
.planCard p{flex:1}
.planBtn{display:inline-block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;border-radius:14px;padding:13px 16px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffd95a,#a57812);color:#07101b;font-weight:900}
.footer{margin-top:22px;color:#cfc8b9;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}
@media(max-width:900px){.plans{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:30px}.top{display:block}.logo{margin-bottom:14px}}
</style>

<style>
/* Humateck website cleanup: preparation / guide space only */
.humateckOnlyNotice{
  border:1px solid rgba(255,217,90,.72);
  border-radius:16px;
  padding:18px 20px;
  margin:18px 0;
  background:rgba(255,217,90,.09);
  color:#f4e4b6;
  line-height:1.72;
  font-weight:800;
}
.humateckOnlyNotice strong{color:#ffd95a;}
.humateckOnlyButton{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  min-width:280px;
  min-height:58px;
  padding:14px 22px;
  border:2px solid #d9b256;
  border-radius:14px;
  color:#fff!important;
  font-size:18px;
  font-weight:900;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#5c4315,#15110a);
  text-align:center;
  line-height:1.45;
  margin-top:10px;
}
.oauthReceiveCheckBox,#authStatus,#authStatusSide,#oauthReceiveCheck{display:none!important;}
</style>


<style>
/* Humateck_New003 clean OAuth guide modal */
.guideModal{
  display:none;
  position:fixed;
  inset:0;
  z-index:300;
  background:rgba(0,0,0,.72);
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  padding:24px;
}
.guideModal:target{display:flex!important}
.guideModalBox{
  width:860px!important;
  max-width:calc(100vw - 48px)!important;
  max-height:86vh!important;
  overflow:auto!important;
  border:1px solid #d4a94f!important;
  border-radius:22px!important;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#121a23,#0b1119)!important;
  color:#eee5d5!important;
  padding:30px 34px!important;
  box-shadow:0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.72)!important;
  line-height:1.72!important;
  word-break:keep-all!important;
  overflow-wrap:break-word!important;
  writing-mode:horizontal-tb!important;
  white-space:normal!important;
  text-align:left!important;
}
.guideModalBox *{
  writing-mode:horizontal-tb!important;
  white-space:normal!important;
  text-align:left!important;
}
.guideModalBox h2{
  color:#ffd95a!important;
  margin:0 0 8px!important;
  font-size:28px!important;
  line-height:1.35!important;
}
.guideSubTitle{
  color:#f4e4b6!important;
  font-size:16px!important;
  line-height:1.7!important;
  margin:0 0 18px!important;
}
.guideIntroBox,.guideWarning{
  border:1px solid rgba(255,217,90,.55);
  border-radius:16px;
  background:rgba(255,217,90,.08);
  padding:16px 18px;
  margin:16px 0 22px;
}
.guideSection{
  border:1px solid rgba(214,176,78,.34);
  border-radius:16px;
  background:rgba(5,11,20,.42);
  padding:16px 18px;
  margin:14px 0;
}
.guideModalBox h3{
  color:#ffd95a!important;
  margin:0 0 8px!important;
  font-size:19px!important;
  line-height:1.45!important;
}
.guideModalBox p{
  color:#eee5d5!important;
  margin:6px 0!important;
  line-height:1.72!important;
  font-size:15.5px!important;
}
.guidePoint{color:#ffd95a!important;font-weight:900!important}
.guideCode{
  display:inline-block;
  padding:2px 8px;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,217,90,.45);
  border-radius:999px;
  color:#ffd95a;
  background:rgba(255,217,90,.08);
  font-weight:900;
}
.guideList{margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:19px}
.guideList li{
  color:#eee5d5!important;
  line-height:1.7!important;
  font-size:15.5px!important;
  margin:5px 0!important;
}
.guideCloudBtn{
  display:inline-flex!important;
  align-items:center!important;
  justify-content:center!important;
  min-width:230px!important;
  min-height:46px!important;
  margin:10px 0 4px!important;
  padding:10px 18px!important;
  border:2px solid #d9b256!important;
  border-radius:12px!important;
  color:#fff!important;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#5c4315,#15110a)!important;
  font-weight:900!important;
  text-decoration:none!important;
  text-align:center!important;
}
.closeModalBtn{
  display:inline-flex!important;
  align-items:center!important;
  justify-content:center!important;
  min-width:120px!important;
  min-height:42px!important;
  margin-top:18px!important;
  border:1px solid #caa24e!important;
  padding:10px 18px!important;
  border-radius:10px!important;
  color:#fff!important;
  background:rgba(255,217,90,.08)!important;
  font-weight:900!important;
  text-align:center!important;
}
@media(max-width:760px){
  .guideModalBox{padding:22px 20px!important}
  .guideModalBox h2{font-size:24px!important}
}
</style>

</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<header class="top">
  <a href="/index.html"><img class="logo" src="../../FINAL_LOGO01.png" alt="Humateck"></a>
  <a class="nav" href="/index.html">첫페이지 가기</a>
</header>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="kicker"> Extension Version</div>
  <h1>유튜브 다국어 번역/등록 플랜</h1>
</section>
<section class="plans">
<article class="planCard" onclick="alert(\'결제와 구독자 관리는  바로가기</a>
</article>
<article class="planCard" onclick="alert(\'결제와 구독자 관리는  바로가기</a>
</article>
<article class="planCard" onclick="alert(\'결제와 구독자 관리는  바로가기</a>
</article>
<article class="planCard" onclick="alert(\'결제와 구독자 관리는  바로가기</a>
</article>
<article class="planCard" onclick="alert(\'결제와 구독자 관리는  바로가기</a>
</article>
</section>
<p class="footer">결제는 Paddle을 통해 진행됩니다.</p>
</div>
<script>
document.querySelectorAll("[data-paddle-placeholder]").forEach(function(btn){
  btn.addEventListener("click", function(e){
    e.preventDefault();
    alert("판 결제창으로 연결됩니다.");
  });
});
</script>

<div class="notice" style="margin-top:18px;">
<b>Google OAuth 중요 안내</b><br><br>

1. Google OAuth Client ID 생성은 보통 최초 1회만 필요합니다.<br>
2. 다만 Google 인증 자체는 토큰 만료, 브라우저 변경, 계정 변경, 장기간 미사용, 권한 철회 등의 경우 다시 요청될 수 있습니다.<br>
3. 여러 채널을 운영하시더라도, 동일 Google 계정이 해당 채널의 관리 권한을 가지고 있다면 실제 영상 주소(videoId) 기준으로 등록할 수 있습니다.<br>
4. 반드시 Google Cloud에서 Web application 방식으로 OAuth Client를 생성해 주세요.<br>
5. Authorized JavaScript origins에는 실제 홈페이지 주소를 등록해야 합니다.<br>
예: https://humateck.com<br>
6. Google OAuth 인증은 Google 공식 보안절차이며 서비스 오류가 아닙니다.<br>
7. 다국어 등록 작업을 자주 진행하는 크리에이터는 Google 재승인을 다시 요청받을 수 있습니다.
</div>

</body>
</html>
